ind":"announcement","title":"Joker Challenge Unlocked! Online Match Timers Added","summary":"Duck Fest’s demo has been updated!This update adds a new challenge after completing the demo, plus optional timers for online Friend Matches.Take on JokerClear the demo to unlock Challenge Mode and face Joker. If you’ve finished the story, put your deck to the test!Set the pace for online matchesIn Friend Matches, the host can now choose a time limit in the lobby: a per-turn timer or a time bank. You can adjust the duration, or keep timers off as before.Have you tried the Joker fight? Found a ti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T21:04:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4921020-1844751498225040","game_id":"steam-4921020","kind":"update","title":"Mini Update: Improved Visuals and Battle Effects","summary":"We've updated the Duck Fest demo!This mini update focuses on brighter visuals and more satisfying battle presentation.What's new- Adjusted the colors of the title and battle screens- Added hand-drawn animation to the title logo- Added feather effects when cards are played- Refreshed the cut-ins shown when the flag changes hands- Improved round and match result presentations- Fixed issues with the tutorial and battle flowThe free demo is available now on Steam.Please give it a try and let us know","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T15:50:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225040","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4921020-1843481262705162","game_id":"steam-4921020","kind":"update","title":"Major Tutorial Update + DuckFest Drills","summary":"The Duck Fest demo has been updated to Ver. 0.6.0!This update significantly improves the tutorial and introduces the new DuckFest Drills.MAJOR TUTORIAL IMPROVEMENTSThe basic game rules and card effect lessons are now taught separately, making them easier to learn step by step.The first battle focuses on the victory conditions, card placement, capturing the flag, and the flow of turns and rounds.Dialogue, guidance, and presentation have also been revised to make your next objective clearer.DUCKFE","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T17:03:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705162","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4921020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:20Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4921020":"2026-10-26T05:12:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4921020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4961410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4921020","app_id":4921020,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7a453aca8706f91754d4ec82ff2fe454a004d9008cb50a1a3b829e6bbc941a3a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Claim flags instead of defeating your opponent in this 1v1 trading card game. Use playing cards and placement to take, retake, and defend flags. Even after claiming 